NervAOSP
========

NervAOSP is a LineageOS 23.2-based Android 16 custom ROM.

Getting started
---------------

Initialize and sync the source:

```
repo init -u https://github.com/NervAOSP/Manifest.git -b 16.2 --git-lfs --depth 1
```
Then sync:
```
repo sync -c --force-sync --no-clone-bundle --no-tags -j$(nproc)
```

Initialize the build environment, then select a supported device target:

NervAOSP platform forks are declared in `snippets/nerva.xml`. Device trees,
proprietary vendor files, and kernels are added separately through
`.repo/local_manifests/` or a device manifest repository.

# Build

- Set up the build environment
```bash
. b*/env*
```

- Lunch a target
```bash
lunch lineage_codename-bp4a-user
```

- To start compiling
```bash
m bacon
```
